# Cloud Build uploads this directory before it reads the Dockerfile, so anything not
# listed here is paid for in upload time. The image needs four paths; ignore everything
# else and negate those back in.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!app/**
!fixtures/**

# Negation above would otherwise drag caches and bytecode into the image layer.
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
